  "title": "Inline Spot Hover Cards",
  "description": "Headline with three inline dots that open into image cards on hover: the dot grows to a fixed card size while the photo fades and sharpens in; a GSAP ticker loop then lerps the card toward the pointer (drift clamped to a radius, tilt clamped to an angle) and moves the photo the opposite way, as if seen through glass, with an iridescent edge on the open card. Leaving collapses it back to a breathing dot. Desktop only.",
